{"seq":4,"slug":"play-store-release","title":"Play Store 发布","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/build-and-release/play-store-release","wordCount":969,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"play-store-发布\">Play Store 发布</h1><p>将 Android 应用发布到 Google Play Store 涉及签名、打包、测试轨道管理和发布策略。掌握完整的发布流程是将应用交付给用户的关键。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>发布流程围绕四个核心概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>签名体系</strong>：开发者用上传密钥签名 AAB，Google Play 用 App Signing Key 重签名并分发；密钥与密码必须置于环境变量或 <code>local.properties</code>，绝不硬编码。</li>\n<li><strong>AAB 分发</strong>：App Bundle 按设备语言/密度/ABI 拆分为优化 APK，用户下载体积更小，是 Play Store 的推荐格式（上限 150 MB + 按需模块）。</li>\n<li><strong>分阶段发布</strong>：从小比例用户（1%–5%）起步，在崩溃率、ANR 率等指标健康时逐步扩大到全量，异常即暂停。</li>\n<li><strong>测试轨道与自动化</strong>：内部/封闭/开放三条测试轨道覆盖不同阶段，CI/CD 可借 Gradle Play Publisher 插件实现无人值守发布与轨道提升。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"应用签名\">应用签名</h2><p>Android 应用必须使用数字证书签名才能安装。Google Play 推荐使用 App Signing by Google Play 托管签名密钥。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"android {&#10;    signingConfigs {&#10;        create(&quot;release&quot;) {&#10;            storeFile = file(System.getenv(&quot;KEYSTORE_PATH&quot;) ?: &quot;release.keystore&quot;)&#10;            storePassword = System.getenv(&quot;KEYSTORE_PASSWORD&quot;) ?: &quot;&quot;&#10;            keyAlias = System.getenv(&quot;KEY_ALIAS&quot;) ?: &quot;&quot;&#10;            keyPassword = System.getenv(&quot;KEY_PASSWORD&quot;) ?: &quot;&quot;&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    buildTypes {&#10;        release {&#10;            signingConfig = signingConfigs.getByName(&quot;release&quot;)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>android {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    signingConfigs {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        create(\"release\") {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            storeFile = file(System.getenv(\"KEYSTORE_PATH\") ?: \"release.keystore\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            storePassword = System.getenv(\"KEYSTORE_PASSWORD\") ?: \"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            keyAlias = System.getenv(\"KEY_ALIAS\") ?: \"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            keyPassword = System.getenv(\"KEY_PASSWORD\") ?: \"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    buildTypes {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        release {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            signingConfig = signingConfigs.getByName(\"release\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[开发者] --&gt; B[上传密钥 Upload Key]&#10;    B --&gt; C[签名 AAB]&#10;    C --&gt; D[上传到 Play Console]&#10;    D --&gt; E[Google Play]&#10;    E --&gt; F[App Signing Key]&#10;    F --&gt; G[重新签名 APK]&#10;    G --&gt; H[分发给用户]&#10;&#10;    classDef googleStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px&#10;    class E,F googleStyle\">graph TD\n    A[开发者] --&gt; B[上传密钥 Upload Key]\n    B --&gt; C[签名 AAB]\n    C --&gt; D[上传到 Play Console]\n    D --&gt; E[Google Play]\n    E --&gt; F[App Signing Key]\n    F --&gt; G[重新签名 APK]\n    G --&gt; H[分发给用户]\n\n    classDef googleStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    class E,F googleStyle</pre><p>签名密钥类型：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>密钥类型</th>\n<th>持有者</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>安全性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>上传密钥</td>\n<td>开发者</td>\n<td>签名上传的 AAB</td>\n<td>可轮换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>App Signing Key</td>\n<td>Google</td>\n<td>最终签名分发的 APK</td>\n<td>Google 托管</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 切勿将签名密钥和密码硬编码在构建脚本中，使用环境变量或 <code>local.properties</code>（已加入 <code>.gitignore</code>）存储。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"app-bundle-aab\">App Bundle（AAB）</h2><p>Android App Bundle 是推荐的发布格式，Google Play 根据用户设备生成优化的 APK。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"android {&#10;    bundle {&#10;        language {&#10;            enableSplit = true&#10;        }&#10;        density {&#10;            enableSplit = true&#10;        }&#10;        abi {&#10;            enableSplit = true&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 构建命令&#10;// ./gradlew bundleRelease\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>android {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    bundle {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        language {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            enableSplit = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        density {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            enableSplit = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        abi {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            enableSplit = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 构建命令</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ./gradlew bundleRelease</span></span></code></pre></div><p>AAB vs APK 对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>AAB</th>\n<th>APK</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>体积</td>\n<td>更小（按设备优化）</td>\n<td>较大（包含所有资源）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分发</td>\n<td>Play Store 专用</td>\n<td>通用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动态功能</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>签名</td>\n<td>Google Play 重签名</td>\n<td>开发者直接签名</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上限</td>\n<td>150 MB（+ 按需模块）</td>\n<td>100 MB</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[AAB 上传] --&gt; B[Google Play]&#10;    B --&gt; C{用户设备}&#10;    C --&gt;|arm64 + xxhdpi + zh| D[优化 APK 1]&#10;    C --&gt;|arm32 + xhdpi + en| E[优化 APK 2]&#10;    C --&gt;|x86 + mdpi + ja| F[优化 APK 3]&#10;&#10;    classDef deviceStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px&#10;    class D,E,F deviceStyle\">graph LR\n    A[AAB 上传] --&gt; B[Google Play]\n    B --&gt; C{用户设备}\n    C --&gt;|arm64 + xxhdpi + zh| D[优化 APK 1]\n    C --&gt;|arm32 + xhdpi + en| E[优化 APK 2]\n    C --&gt;|x86 + mdpi + ja| F[优化 APK 3]\n\n    classDef deviceStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    class D,E,F deviceStyle</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"分阶段发布\">分阶段发布</h2><p>分阶段发布允许逐步将更新推送给用户，降低大规模问题的风险。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[1% 用户] --&gt; B[5% 用户]&#10;    B --&gt; C[10% 用户]&#10;    C --&gt; D[25% 用户]&#10;    D --&gt; E[50% 用户]&#10;    E --&gt; F[100% 全量发布]&#10;&#10;    A -.-&gt;|监控崩溃率| G{崩溃率 &lt; 阈值?}&#10;    G --&gt;|是| B&#10;    G --&gt;|否| H[暂停发布]&#10;    H --&gt; I[修复问题]&#10;    I --&gt; A&#10;&#10;    classDef monitorStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px&#10;    class G monitorStyle\">graph LR\n    A[1% 用户] --&gt; B[5% 用户]\n    B --&gt; C[10% 用户]\n    C --&gt; D[25% 用户]\n    D --&gt; E[50% 用户]\n    E --&gt; F[100% 全量发布]\n\n    A -.-&gt;|监控崩溃率| G{崩溃率 &lt; 阈值?}\n    G --&gt;|是| B\n    G --&gt;|否| H[暂停发布]\n    H --&gt; I[修复问题]\n    I --&gt; A\n\n    classDef monitorStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    class G monitorStyle</pre><p>分阶段发布的关键指标监控：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>健康阈值</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>崩溃率</td>\n<td>&lt; 1%</td>\n<td>用户无崩溃率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ANR 率</td>\n<td>&lt; 0.47%</td>\n<td>应用无响应率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>卸载率</td>\n<td>未显著增长</td>\n<td>用户留存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>评分</td>\n<td>未显著下降</td>\n<td>用户满意度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 首次发布新版本时建议从 1-5% 开始，观察 24-48 小时的崩溃数据后再逐步扩大。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"内部测试\">内部测试</h2><p>Play Console 提供多个测试轨道，用于不同阶段的测试。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>轨道</th>\n<th>参与者</th>\n<th>审核</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>内部测试</td>\n<td>最多 100 人</td>\n<td>快速（分钟级）</td>\n<td>团队内部快速验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>封闭测试</td>\n<td>自定义列表或组</td>\n<td>需要审核</td>\n<td>外部 Beta 测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>开放测试</td>\n<td>所有人可加入</td>\n<td>需要审核</td>\n<td>公开 Beta 测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>正式版</td>\n<td>所有用户</td>\n<td>需要审核</td>\n<td>正式发布</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>CI/CD 自动化发布脚本：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// 使用 Gradle Play Publisher 插件自动化上传&#10;plugins {&#10;    id(&quot;com.github.triplet.play&quot;) version &quot;3.9.1&quot;&#10;}&#10;&#10;play {&#10;    serviceAccountCredentials.set(file(&quot;play-service-account.json&quot;))&#10;    track.set(&quot;internal&quot;)&#10;    defaultToAppBundles.set(true)&#10;    releaseStatus.set(ReleaseStatus.DRAFT)&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 命令行发布&#10;// ./gradlew publishReleaseBundle --track=internal&#10;// ./gradlew promoteArtifact --from-track=internal --to-track=production\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 使用 Gradle Play Publisher 插件自动化上传</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>plugins {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    id(\"com.github.triplet.play\") version \"3.9.1\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>play {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    serviceAccountCredentials.set(file(\"play-service-account.json\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    track.set(\"internal\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    defaultToAppBundles.set(true)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    releaseStatus.set(ReleaseStatus.DRAFT)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 命令行发布</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ./gradlew publishReleaseBundle --track=internal</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ./gradlew promoteArtifact --from-track=internal --to-track=production</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// 版本号自动管理&#10;android {&#10;    defaultConfig {&#10;        val versionMajor = 1&#10;        val versionMinor = 2&#10;        val versionPatch = 3&#10;        val buildNumber = System.getenv(&quot;BUILD_NUMBER&quot;)?.toIntOrNull() ?: 1&#10;&#10;        versionCode = versionMajor * 10000 + versionMinor * 100 + versionPatch&#10;        versionName = &quot;$versionMajor.$versionMinor.$versionPatch&quot;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 版本号自动管理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>android {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    defaultConfig {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val versionMajor = 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val versionMinor = 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val versionPatch = 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val buildNumber = System.getenv(\"BUILD_NUMBER\")?.toIntOrNull() ?: 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        versionCode = versionMajor * 10000 + versionMinor * 100 + versionPatch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        versionName = \"$versionMajor.$versionMinor.$versionPatch\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"发布管理\">发布管理</h2><p>发布管理涵盖版本策略、发布说明和回滚计划。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// 发布检查清单&#10;data class ReleaseChecklist(&#10;    val allTestsPassed: Boolean,&#10;    val proguardMappingUploaded: Boolean,&#10;    val releaseNotesWritten: Boolean,&#10;    val performanceBenchmarked: Boolean,&#10;    val accessibilityChecked: Boolean,&#10;    val privacyPolicyUpdated: Boolean,&#10;    val screenshotsUpdated: Boolean&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 发布检查清单</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data class ReleaseChecklist(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val allTestsPassed: Boolean,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val proguardMappingUploaded: Boolean,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val releaseNotesWritten: Boolean,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val performanceBenchmarked: Boolean,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val accessibilityChecked: Boolean,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val privacyPolicyUpdated: Boolean,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val screenshotsUpdated: Boolean</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>发布前检查清单：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>检查项</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单元测试</td>\n<td>所有测试通过</td>\n<td>JUnit + MockK</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UI 测试</td>\n<td>关键流程测试通过</td>\n<td>Compose Test / Espresso</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能基准</td>\n<td>无性能退化</td>\n<td>Macrobenchmark</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代码混淆</td>\n<td>mapping.txt 已保存</td>\n<td>R8</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>崩溃监控</td>\n<td>SDK 已集成</td>\n<td>Firebase Crashlytics</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>隐私政策</td>\n<td>符合最新要求</td>\n<td>Play Console</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>发布说明</td>\n<td>多语言版本准备</td>\n<td>Play Console</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[代码合并到 main] --&gt; B[CI 构建 AAB]&#10;    B --&gt; C[运行测试套件]&#10;    C --&gt; D{测试通过?}&#10;    D --&gt;|否| E[修复问题]&#10;    E --&gt; A&#10;    D --&gt;|是| F[上传到内部测试]&#10;    F --&gt; G[QA 团队验证]&#10;    G --&gt; H{验证通过?}&#10;    H --&gt;|否| E&#10;    H --&gt;|是| I[提升到封闭测试]&#10;    I --&gt; J[Beta 用户反馈]&#10;    J --&gt; K[提升到正式版]&#10;    K --&gt; L[分阶段发布]&#10;&#10;    classDef ciStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px&#10;    class B,C ciStyle\">graph TD\n    A[代码合并到 main] --&gt; B[CI 构建 AAB]\n    B --&gt; C[运行测试套件]\n    C --&gt; D{测试通过?}\n    D --&gt;|否| E[修复问题]\n    E --&gt; A\n    D --&gt;|是| F[上传到内部测试]\n    F --&gt; G[QA 团队验证]\n    G --&gt; H{验证通过?}\n    H --&gt;|否| E\n    H --&gt;|是| I[提升到封闭测试]\n    I --&gt; J[Beta 用户反馈]\n    J --&gt; K[提升到正式版]\n    K --&gt; L[分阶段发布]\n\n    classDef ciStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    class B,C ciStyle</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 使用 <code>versionCode</code> 的数值设计留有余量（如 major<em>10000 + minor</em>100 + patch），方便未来插入热修复版本。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>应用签名使用上传密钥签名 AAB，Google Play 使用 App Signing Key 分发</li>\n<li>AAB 格式通过按需分发减小用户下载体积，是 Play Store 的推荐格式</li>\n<li>分阶段发布从小比例用户开始，监控崩溃率等指标后逐步扩大</li>\n<li>内部测试轨道适合团队快速验证，封闭/开放测试用于 Beta 阶段</li>\n<li>CI/CD 自动化配合 Gradle Play Publisher 插件实现无人值守发布</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Play Store 发布","id":"play-store-发布"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"应用签名","id":"应用签名"},{"level":2,"text":"App Bundle（AAB）","id":"app-bundle-aab"},{"level":2,"text":"分阶段发布","id":"分阶段发布"},{"level":2,"text":"内部测试","id":"内部测试"},{"level":2,"text":"发布管理","id":"发布管理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"ProGuard 与 R8","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/build-and-release/proguard-and-r8"},"next":{"title":"单元测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/testing/unit-testing"}}